{"title":"Jacquard Woven Photo Wall Tapestries","description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ctable width=\"100%\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e \u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT-PhotoTapestry-CatHeader_01_1_medium.png?v=1499658301\" alt=\"photo tapestry wall hanging\"\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/home-decor\" title=\"Home Decor by PersonalThrows\"\u003eHome Decor\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-canvases\"\u003ePhoto Canvases\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/jacquard-woven-photo-wall-tapestries\"\u003eWall Tapestries\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/microfleece-photo-pillows\"\u003eMicrofleece Pillows\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/jacquard-woven-photo-pillows\"\u003eWoven Pillows\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/personalized-floormats\"\u003eFloormats\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eLooking to add a bit of rustic and sentimental touch to your house to make it feel homier? Our jacquard woven photo wall tapestry are exactly what you’re looking for!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Jacquard loom woven from a 6-color pattern based on your image.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFunctionality:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully Backed with Sewn Rod Pocket for easy hanging.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% Egyptian Cotton\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 4-5 Weeks.","products":[{"product_id":"jacquard-woven-photo-wall-tapestry-26-x-36-small","title":"Jac